OL,3,AAfghan woman deported from US in first
OL,4,Ause of 'alien terrorist' court
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn Afghan woman living in Texas with
OL,7,Flegal US permanent residency has been
OL,8,Fdeported from the country in the
OL,9,Ffirst-ever use of a secretive court.
OL,11,FNazira Haji Zada, 47, chose to leave
OL,12,Fthe US rather than continue to argue
OL,13,Fher case before the Alien Terrorist
OL,14,FRemoval Court, according to the US
OL,15,FDepartment of Justice (DOJ) and her
OL,16,Flawyers.
OL,23,APub: 12-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,320,300,200,140,0,100
