OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AAfghan woman deported from US in first
OL,4,Ause of 'alien terrorist' court
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Alien Terrorist Removal Court was
OL,7,Fcreated in 1996, but had never heard a
OL,8,Fcase before the proceedings in July. It
OL,9,Fis meant for non-US citizens facing
OL,10,Fterrorism-related charges when the
OL,11,Fevidence is confidential and related to
OL,12,Fnational security.
OL,14,FLawyers for Haji Zada argued that the
OL,15,Fcase violated her right to due process
OL,16,Funder the US Constitution.
OL,23,APub: 12-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
